.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-get 1 "" "Sway Things 0.0.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-get \- Show the value in effect and where it comes from; without a key, every stored setting
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things get\fR [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIKEY\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the value in effect and where it comes from; without a key, every stored setting
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<IDENTIFIER>\fR
The input device, by its identifier as `swaymsg \-t get_inputs` shows it
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON for scripts
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIKEY\fR]
The setting, e.g. windows.gaps.inner
